<section class="box-exercise">
<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Organic_Chemistry_(Morsch_et_al.)/24:_Amines_and_Heterocycles/24.01:_Naming_Amines" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B1.7D.5C)"></span><h5 class="box-legend" id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B1.7D.5C)-36439"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise \(\PageIndex{1}\)</span></h5>

